m/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681434276/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5690995744","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123418#issuecomment-5690995744","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123418","id":5690995744,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUzW0IA","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T02:14:58Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T02:14:58Z","body":"Ok, @dsnopek figured out that our problem lied when our node gets paused. So I ensured our process mode is set to always by default, and we get a warning if this is not the case.\r\n\r\nI'm still experiencing a problem intermittedly where it looks like we're not getting placement data at all. That may be an intirely separate problem.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5690995744/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5696563406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123418#issuecomment-5696563406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123418","id":5696563406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABU4qozg","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T11:16:18Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T11:16:18Z","body":"@dsnopek @m4gr3d after a bunch of testing today I found two more things.\r\n\r\n1. This likely is not a problem on our side, but the head transform we obtain by querying the play space -> view space relationship is wrong. I think it's rotation is inverted. As the orientation difference between the head pose and the eye poses increases, there is a point our logic breaks. I've worked around this by not using this approach when containers are used, but instead I now determine the head pose by taking the center point between the two eye poses. This does mean we loose velocity information.\r\n2.  Not 100% sure about this one, but I build a few arrays to store view data in to send to the rendering thread assuming this data would be copied when added to the thread queue. To save some memory allocation these were defined as thread_local. I think that didn't work.\r\n\r\nThis for me is now working very stable with Kenneys starter kit demo.\r\nIt is still complaining at startup, when the container isn't setup, we don't seem to be retrieving usable data and the rendering engine does not like that. But that is unrelated to the issue we're trying to resolve in this PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5696563406/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5719006725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123418#issuecomment-5719006725","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123418","id":5719006725,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVOEeBQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-17T18:03:56Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T18:03:56Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5719006725/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]